  "question": {
    "text": "The order of the differential equation of the family of circles touching the&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi></math>-axis at the origin is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>,&nbsp;then the maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/9490eb1d-8ff9-4275-9c3b-3fddc1da0d9c.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.69375in;height:1.55347in\" /></p><p>The equation of the family is <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>, which has only one arbitrary constant<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> the order will be <math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Hence, the maximum value of <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> is <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>&#8217;</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
